From: NixOS Orange Pi Zero 2W configuration
Subject: media: cedrus: Use the H616 variant for H616

The Armbian H616 variant patch defines the correct 600 MHz variant but leaves
the match table pointing at the H6 data. Use the H616 data it introduced.

---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -707,7 +707,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id cedrus_dt_match[] = {
 	},
 	{
 		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-video-engine",
-		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
+		.data = &sun50i_h616_cedrus_variant,
 	},
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
 };
